# File Management

## Copy a file to remote server

```bash
ansible all -b -m copy -a "src=index.html dest=/var/www/html/index.html"
```

## Copy a directory

```bash
ansible all -b -m copy -a "src=app/ dest=/opt/app/"
```

## Create a directory

```bash
ansible all -b -m file -a "path=/opt/application state=directory mode=0755"
```

## Create an empty file

```bash
ansible all -b -m file -a "path=/tmp/demo.txt state=touch"
```

## Delete a file

```bash
ansible all -b -m file -a "path=/tmp/demo.txt state=absent"
```

## Delete a directory

```bash
ansible all -b -m file -a "path=/opt/application state=absent"
```

## Change file permissions

```bash
ansible all -b -m file -a "path=/var/www/html/index.html mode=0644"
```

## Change file owner

```bash
ansible all -b -m file -a "path=/var/www/html owner=ubuntu group=ubuntu"
```

## Download a file from URL

```bash
ansible all -b -m get_url -a "url=https://example.com/app.jar dest=/opt/app.jar"
```

## Synchronize files

```bash
ansible all -b -m synchronize -a "src=website/ dest=/var/www/html/"
```
